  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CDA is a think-tank within conflict management, humanitarian aid and  development, gathering and analysing experiences from development     cooperation to draw lessons learned and to avoid that misstakes are   repeated. CDA conducts several different projects; Do No Harm,        Reflecting on Peace Practices, Listening Project and the Corporate    Engagement Project</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">CDA &#xe4;r en think tank och EO inom konflikthantering, humanit&#xe4;rt st&#xf6;d   och utveckling, som samlar och analyserar erfarenheter av             utvecklingssamarbete f&#xf6;r att l&#xe4;ra av goda exempel och undvika att     misstag repeteras. CDA bedriver ett antal delprojekt: Do No Harm,     Reflecting on Peace Practises, Listening Project och the Corporate    Engagement Project</narrative>
  </description>
